I worry a bit about treating "out of" as a unit, separate from the verbs in=
volved: "made out of" is very different from either "get out of" or from "g=
o out of" or even from "be out of" in sevreal of its meanings.=A0 And examp=
les could multiply, not much of a common even very general meaning.

